<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>basketball matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Moscow: Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 71 Partizan Belgrade</p>
<p>(Yugoslavia) 72 (halftime 42-37)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Zagreb: Cibona Zagreb (Croatia) 64 Teamsystem Bologna</p>
<p>(Italy) 71 (30-31)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Zagreb - Damir Mulaomerovic 13, Evgeny Kissourine 9, Dzevad</p>
<p>Alihodzic 8</p>
<p>Bologna - Conrad McRae 19, Carlton Myers 19, Alessandro</p>
<p>Frosini 12</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Barcelona (Spain) 78 Villeurbanne (France) 81 (39-36)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Barcelona - Rafa Jofresa (15), Arturas Karnisovas (15), Roger Esteller (16), Andrei Fetissov (12).</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Delaney Rudd (36), Alain Digbeau (13), Georges Adams (8), Jim Bilba (8)</p>
